  partName: Mounting Bolt (3)
  description: The Mounting Bolt (3) is a tiny, elongated bolt located at the top-center-front
    of the engine, playing a crucial role in securing the engine's position and ensuring
    proper alignment. Made of Material.001, this bolt withstands significant stress
    and vibration, making it a vital component for engine stability. Interestingly,
    its tiny size belies its importance, as it helps maintain the engine's balance
    and prevents damage from misalignment.
